# 26. BERITA POPULER

Berita populer dapat dihitung berdasarkan:

* Jumlah views.
* Rating.
* Jumlah rating.

Contoh formula sederhana:

```text
Popularity Score =
Views + (Rating × Jumlah Rating)
```

Formula dapat disesuaikan pada tahap implementasi.

---

# 27. SEO

Website harus memperhatikan SEO dasar.

Setiap halaman/berita memiliki:

* SEO Title.
* Meta Description.
* Slug.
* Canonical URL.
* Open Graph Title.
* Open Graph Description.
* Open Graph Image.

Sistem juga menghasilkan:

```text
/sitemap.xml
/robots.txt
```

URL harus SEO friendly.

Contoh:

```text
/berita/lwp-pwnu-jatim-gelar-pelatihan-nazhir
```

bukan:

```text
/detail.php?id=123
```

